EN:
There's a fortune-teller named
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Katrina {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}here in town today,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}She's so mysterious and cool!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Why don't you get a reading?

ES:
Hoy está en el pueblo una
adivina llamada {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Katrina{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}¡Es misteriosa y me encanta!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿Por qué no vas a que
te lea la fortuna?

IT:
C'è una veggente di nome
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Vanda {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}qui in città oggi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Che tipa affascinante e misteriosa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Perché non ti fai leggere le carte?

TRANSLATION:
Bugün kasabada {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Katrina {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}diye bir falcı var,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Çok gizemli ve havalı!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bir fal baktırmaya ne dersin?

ES:
Parece que hoy está aquí {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Ladino{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
vendiendo cosas.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0013:}}Se hace llamar
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Ladino el Honrado{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, pero no sé yo...

DE:
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Reiner{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} ist heute in der Stadt und
verkauft Kunst und Krempel.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Das sagen die anderen jedenfalls...
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Für mich sieht aber alles von
{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Reiner{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} wie Kunst aus,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
äh, he he he.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Those letters in your mailbox{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} are
delivered by a dude named {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Pete{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I bet he has to get up super early.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sounds rough,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Peter{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} bringt uns immer die Post.
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Der steht bestimmt richtig früh auf.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Das könnt ich nicht,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}¡{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Soponcio {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}me ha pedido
que le ayude en Halloween!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Quizá también te lo pida a ti!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Jakob {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}will, dass ich ihm an
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Halloween{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} helfe!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Nicht sauer sein,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
vielleicht fragt er dich ja auch noch!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Leif{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} from the gardening center{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
is supposed to be cleaning up the
town today!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}But when I saw him earlier,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
he looked like he was taking a nap.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Gandulio{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, del centro de jardinería,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
tendría que estar hoy limpiando
el pueblo...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Pero cuando lo vi antes, yo diría
que estaba echando una siesta.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Te lo digo yo, que entiendo de eso.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bahçe merkezinden {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Leif{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} bugün kasabayı
temizleyecekmiş!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Ama az önce gördüğümde{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
kestiriyor gibiydi.
